<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="container mt-5 mb-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-10 offset-lg-1">
            
            <!-- Page Heading with Divider -->
            <div class="text-center mb-5">
                <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark display-5"><%= title %></h1>
                <hr class="w-25 mx-auto border-dark border-2 opacity-75">
            </div>
            
            <!-- Profile Photo & Video Introduction Section -->
            <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
                <!-- Profile Image -->
                <div class="col-md-5 text-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
                    <img src="/images/profile.jpg" alt="Muhammad Soban Ajmal" class="img-fluid rounded-circle shadow-lg border border-3 border-dark" style="max-width: 260px; height: 260px; object-fit: cover;">
                </div>
                
                <!-- Video Player Card -->
                <div class="col-md-7">
                    <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 bg-light p-2">
                        <div class="card-body p-0">
                            <h5 class="card-title fw-bold mb-3 px-3 pt-3 text-dark">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-video me-2"></i> Video Introduction
                            </h5>
                            <!-- Standard HTML5 Video Tag -->
                            <video controls class="w-100 rounded shadow-sm bg-dark" style="max-height: 280px;">
                                <source src="/videos/intro.mp4" type="video/mp4">
                                Your browser does not support the video tag.
                            </video>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Bio Card (Aligned with your video introduction) -->
            <div class="card shadow border-0 bg-light p-4 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-4">
                        <div class="bg-dark text-white rounded-circle p-3 me-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-1">Muhammad Soban Ajmal</h3>
                            <p class="text-muted mb-0">Ontario Tech University — Networking and IT Security Student</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <p class="fs-6 lh-base">
                        Hi, my name is Muhammad Soban Ajmal and I am a student at Ontario Tech University studying in the networking and IT security program. For one of my projects, I decided to build my own portfolio website from scratch—not just as a design exercise, but as a way to apply what I'm learning in my program.
                    </p>
                    <p class="fs-6 lh-base">
                        Since my background is networking and IT security, I wanted this site to reflect that. I focused on clean code, fast performance, and making sure the site is secure and well-structured. The goal of this project is to create a digital resume that truly represents who I am as a developer and security student.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Beyond the Code Card -->
            <div class="card shadow border-0 bg-white border-top border-dark border-4">
                <div class="card-body p-4">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3">
                        <div class="bg-secondary text-white rounded-circle p-3 me-3">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-microchip fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="card-title fw-bold mb-0">Beyond the Code</h3>
                    </div>
                    <p class="fs-6 lh-base text-muted mb-0">
                        When I’m not writing scripts or studying network infrastructure, you can usually find me working with computer hardware. I have a strong interest in building custom desktop PCs, diagnosing hardware issues, and optimizing system performance. In my downtime, I enjoy gaming and staying up-to-date with the latest tech trends.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>